Package: OpenCLeaR
Type: Package
Title: Easy Access to OpenCL using C++, CMake and Rcpp
Version: 0.6.0
Author: Albrecht Gebhardt
Authors@R: person(given = "Albrecht",
                family = "Gebhardt",
                role = c("aut", "cre"),
                email = "albrecht.gebhardt@aau.at")
Maintainer: Albrecht Gebhardt <albrecht.gebhardt@aau.at>
Description: OpenCL Easy Accessible from R:
  This package aims to provide easy access to OpenCL coding 
  using a C++ abstraction layer (via a modified OpenCL-Wrapper based on
  <https://github.com/ProjectPhysX/OpenCL-Wrapper>) to interact with 
  low level OpenCl functions. 
  Configuration is done automatically via CMake (thanks to
  <https://github.com/jmaerte/cmake-rcpp-template>).
LinkingTo: Rcpp
Imports: Rcpp, inline
SystemRequirements: OpenCL, CMake
